# Frontend (Astro shell + React app)

## Entry & routing

- **`src/pages/index.astro`** (and related) render the shell; React root is **`src/AppRoot.jsx`** → **`src/App.jsx`**.
- In-app “pages” are **`page` state** in `App.jsx` (not file-based React Router for the main shell). Sidebar switches views (`Dashboard`, `Sites`, `Wizard`, `Settings`, etc.).

## Imports

- Use **`src/components/`** for UI (not legacy root `components/` unless you confirm bundler resolves it — primary codepath is under `src/`).
- Use **`src/services/`** for API (`api.js`), auth, Neon/D1 helpers, Cloudflare DNS, Sentry, etc.
- Use **`src/utils/`** for template routing, preview, fingerprint, wizard capabilities — **see core rule: root `utils/` duplicate hazard**.

## API usage

- Import **`api`** from `src/services/api.js`. Paths are usually like **`/sites`**, **`/ai/generate-reviews`** — the client prepends resolved base and avoids **`/api/api`** duplication via **`buildApiUrlWithBase`**.
- Mutations may send **`X-CSRF-Token`** (sessionStorage). Do not strip this when adding new POST helpers.

## Site / Wizard data

- Persisted site fields must be members of **`SITE_FIELD_KEYS`** in `src/constants/site-fields.js` and handled in **`sanitizeSite`** (and friends) in `App.jsx` when adding new persisted props.
- Deploy-related renames: e.g. Wizard **Voluum** fields map to JSON keys (see comments at top of `site-fields.js`).

## UI patterns

- New surfaces often use **`src/components/ui/*`** (Tailwind + Radix-style primitives). Match existing **`THEME` / `constants`** usage before inventing new token systems.
- **Notifications:** use existing **`notify`** patterns from parent props / toast utilities wired in `App.jsx`.

## Astro LP templates inside repo

- Under **`src/templates/`** or top-level **`templates/`** — different from the **main app**; used as deployable Astro projects. Layouts often read **`import.meta.env.PUBLIC_*`** injected at CI.

## Testing

- Component tests: Vitest + Testing Library in `src/**/__tests__` or `*.test.js` alongside utils.
